<title> Dysmenorrhea: Treatment.</title>
<graphic href="eee0233-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Painful menses; low anterior pelvic pain during 3-day period around start of menses?</label>
<path target="cell-2">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-3">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-2">
<label>Presumptive diagnosis of primary dysmenorrhea.</label>
<path target="cell-4"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>Treat with NSAIDs and&#x002F;or oral contraceptives. Optional suppression of menses with depo-medroxyprogesterone or extended-cycle oral contraceptives. Consider topical heat, acupressure, magnet device, yoga, and&#x002F;or thiamine, vitamin E, or fish oil. Dysmenorrhea controlled?</label>
<path target="cell-5">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-3">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Continue therapy.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-3">
<label>Suspect secondary dysmenorrhea; signs or symptoms of sexually transmitted infection?</label>
<path target="cell-6">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-7">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>Confirm and treat.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>Pelvic ultrasound; consider laparoscopy.</label>
<path target="cell-8"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-8">
<label>Endometriosis?</label>
<path target="cell-9">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-10">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-9">
<label>Consider suppression of menses with depo-medroxyprogesterone or extended-cycle oral contraceptives. Consider surgical options.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-10">
<label>Normal anatomy?</label>
<path target="cell-12">No</path>
<path target="cell-11">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-11">
<label>Unexplained dysmenorrhea.</label>
<path target="cell-13"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-13">
<label>Consider all available treatments.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-12">
<label>Surgery, if indicated.</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
